  "created_at": "Sun Apr 29 01:22:14 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "What I want from blockchain games:\n\n1) be a good game first\n2) explore what makes blockchain unique\n3) design around the limitations\n4) persistent always on world \n5) players own the game, the items and experiences\n6) allow anyone to design and improve the game\n7) embrace bots",
  "lang": "en"
 },
