  "created_at": "Sun Apr 29 01:22:22 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "1) be a good game first \nI see too often people just trying to make yet another skin for a cassino or trading card games. Reminds me of slot machine games, all uniquely identical",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
