  "created_at": "Sun Apr 29 01:22:29 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "4) persistent worlds \n\nYour game doesn’t have multiple servers and will still exist even after you stop developing it. Explore that. Make that communities live and grow on it",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
