  "created_at": "Sun Apr 29 01:22:30 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "5) players own the game \n\nDon’t make a game just so that the users buy stuff from you. Make it so that users own many aspects of the game. They own the land, they own the equipment they own the experience. At some point they should have as much or more control than you.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
