  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "6) allow others to design \n\nYou don’t need to design everything, if you make a great platform others can expand it. Allow them to create new monsters or levels, leave room for someone to update the graphics or make a new expansion.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
